A method of modulating social primitives in an autonomous animated character, comprising the steps of: 
      determining a set of personality traits of said autonomous animated character;  
      selecting at least one social primitive from social primitives related to said set of personality traits to be activated in said autonomous animated character;  
      modulating each of said social primitives to be activated on said autonomous animated character; and  
