A light emitting element comprising:
a first electrode; 
a composite layer being in contact with the first electrode; 
a light emitting layer over the composite layer; 
an electron transporting layer over the light emitting layer; and 
a second electrode over the electron transporting layer, 
wherein the composite layer includes molybdenum oxide and an organic compound, 
