A method for triggering an oscilloscope, said oscilloscope being configured to process a first signal in a first domain and a second signal in a second domain, said method comprising:
choosing a different domain for processing each of said first and second signals, respectively; 
selecting a desired trigger type for one of said chosen domains; 
acquiring said first and second signals in response to an occurrence of a trigger based on said selected trigger type; and 
