 a second flow face edge defined where the first flow face meets the laterally opposing rear side; 
 a third flow face edge defined where the first flow face meets the first end face side; 
 a fourth flow face edge defined where the first flow face meets the second end face side; 

 a plurality of support elements configured as feet arranged on the filter bellows and adapted to support the filter element relative to a filter housing in which the filter element is to be arranged, the plurality of support elements having:
