establishing a connection to at least one external terminal; 
segmenting a content stored in the mobile terminal into segments; 
sharing the content by distributing the segments to the terminals; 
integrating, when a content execution command is input, the segments distributed to the terminals into the content; 
storing the integrated content; and 
