 at least one layer being comprised of a foam material with an open-cell structure; 
 an air filtration foundation coupled to the mattress wherein the air filtration foundation includes a fan assembly; 
 wherein each of the layers is comprised of material that allows air to flow through the layer; and 
 wherein the fan assembly displaces air of varying temperatures. 



       2. The mattress according to  claim 1 , wherein the plurality of layers include a comfort layer, a contour layer, an air foam layer and a foam base layer. 


       3. The mattress according to  claim 1 , wherein the air displaced by the fan assembly is heated. 


