sending, to the selected MHD, a remote control command corresponding to the second user input; and 
analyzing the video frames and the respective timestamps to determine a remote control response metric for the video signal output, the remote control response metric indicative of a response time of the selected MHD to the remote control command.

A method for determining if a domain name is available for registration, comprising:
