preparing a second instance of the operation file, wherein the second instance is distinct from the first instance and comprises updated data;
validating the second instance of the operation file to ensure its readiness for active use; and
switching access for the ongoing online processing from the first instance of the operation file to the second instance of the operation file, wherein said switching causes the ongoing online processing to seamlessly transition its access from the first instance to the second instance without interruption.

