forwarding the modified communication request to the selected server;
receiving, by the network ingress device, a communication response from the selected server, the communication response having a destination network address corresponding to the network address of the network ingress device;
modifying, by the network ingress device, the destination network address of the communication response from the network address of the network ingress device to the client network address, thereby generating a modified communication response; and
transmitting the modified communication response to the client device.

