determining, based on said network topology and said budget constraint, a set of monitor deployment locations from said plurality of network nodes;
wherein said determining comprises optimizing a monitoring objective associated with observability of said network paths by end-to-end probes, subject to said budget constraint;
wherein said observability is determined by capabilities of said monitors at said determined deployment locations to send, receive, or intermediate end-to-end probes along said network paths; and
deploying said plurality of monitors at said determined monitor deployment locations.

