introducing a first dopant type into the semiconductor substrate through the plurality of emitter regions defined by the patterned masking layer to form a plurality of doped emitter regions on the back surface of the semiconductor substrate; and
removing the patterned masking layer from the back surface of the semiconductor substrate.

A system for securely transmitting data using video validation, comprising:
