a processing unit communicatively coupled to the data source and the video capture device, the processing unit configured to receive the data from the data source; receive the video data from the video capture device; analyze the video data to validate compliance with the security requirement; generate a validation outcome based on the analysis; and control transmission of the data based on the validation outcome; and
a communication interface configured to perform transmission of the data when the validation outcome permits transmission.

An apparatus for clamping a lead proximate a bondhead, comprising:
