an application head positioned downstream from the gasket supply mechanism along the feed path, the application head configured to receive the gasket material;
a pressing mechanism coupled to the application head, the pressing mechanism configured to press the gasket material onto a surface of a beam;
a positioning mechanism configured to facilitate relative movement between the application head and the beam to apply the gasket along a desired length of the beam; and
a cutting mechanism positioned to cut the gasket material to a desired length after application to the beam.

A vehicle body front portion structure, comprising:
