A system for adaptive trade specification and match-making optimization, comprising:
a processor;
a memory communicatively coupled to the processor, storing instructions executable by the processor; and
one or more input/output interfaces;
wherein the processor, in communication with the memory and the one or more input/output interfaces, is configured to perform operations including:
receiving, via the one or more input/output interfaces, a plurality of initial trade specifications, each initial trade specification defining at least one desired trade parameter;
dynamically adapting at least one of the initial trade specifications based on a set of adaptive criteria, the adaptive criteria comprising at least one of user preferences, market conditions, or historical trade data, to generate a corresponding adapted trade specification;
