a subtank configured to temporarily store ink supplied to the printhead;
an ink supply source configured to store a main supply of ink;
an ink replenishment mechanism configured to transfer ink from the ink supply source to the subtank;
an ink level detection unit configured to detect an ink level within the subtank; and
a controller coupled to the ink level detection unit and the ink replenishment mechanism, the controller configured to initiate replenishment by activating the ink replenishment mechanism when the detected ink level in the subtank falls below a predetermined first threshold, and further configured to determine an amount of ink replenished to the subtank by receiving a first ink level value from the ink level detection unit prior to initiation of replenishment and receiving a second ink level value from the ink level detection unit after completion of replenishment, and calculating the replenished amount of ink based on a difference between the first ink level value and the second ink level value.

