an output interface communicatively coupled to the processor, the output interface configured to communicate the compensated heart rate measurement;
a power source configured to energize the physiological sensor, the motion sensor, the processor, and the output interface; and
a housing configured to enclose at least the physiological sensor, the motion sensor, the processor, the output interface, and the power source, wherein the housing is configured for wearable attachment to the ambulatory patient.

A system comprising:
