Here is a potential patent claim 1, written as a method claim, adhering to standard patent claim formatting:

A method for content management in a mobile terminal, comprising:
receiving, by the mobile terminal, a plurality of digital content items from at least one diverse source, wherein said diverse source includes at least one of an internal capture device, an external connected device, a network download, and another application executing on the mobile terminal;
analyzing, by a processor of the mobile terminal, characteristics associated with each received digital content item, wherein said characteristics include at least one of content type, source application, creation date, and embedded metadata;
automatically classifying, by the processor, each received digital content item into a predetermined content category based on said analyzed characteristics;
storing the classified digital content items in a memory of the mobile terminal according to their respective predetermined content categories;
generating a unified user interface for display on the mobile terminal, the unified user interface configured to enable a user to browse, search, and perform management operations on the classified digital content items across different sources and storage locations; and
presenting the unified user interface on a display of the mobile terminal.

A switching regulator for converting an input voltage to an output voltage, said switching regulator comprising:
a switch configured to selectively connect a power source to an energy storage element;
an energy storage element electrically coupled to the switch, said energy storage element configured to store energy transferred from the power source; and
a control circuit configured to monitor at least one operating parameter of the switching regulator related to energy stored within said energy storage element;
