a power amplifier coupled to the phase modulator and the amplitude modulator, the power amplifier configured to amplify the phase-modulated RF signal, wherein a supply voltage of the power amplifier is controlled by the modulated supply voltage generated by the amplitude modulator.

A computing system, comprising:
