transmitting said selected specification subset to said specific communication network device; and
configuring said specific communication network device according to said transmitted specification subset, thereby enabling said specific communication network device to operate with said required functional capability while minimizing resource utilization associated with the comprehensive communication standard specification.

A method for transmitting signals to cause replays to be recorded at a plurality of receivers, the method comprising:
