wherein the conductive pathway comprises a bonding interface configured for metallurgical bonding to at least one of the first semiconductor element or the second semiconductor element; and
at least one reservoir disposed adjacent to the bonding interface of the conductive pathway;
wherein the at least one reservoir is configured to store a bonding material; and
wherein the bonding material is configured to be supplied from the at least one reservoir to the bonding interface during a bonding process to form a metallurgical bond between the conductive pathway and at least one of the first semiconductor element or the second semiconductor element.

A luminous fishing lure, comprising:
