    an inverter electrically coupled between the battery pack and the at least one electric motor, said inverter configured to convert direct current (DC) power from the battery pack into alternating current (AC) power for the at least one electric motor;
    a controller electrically coupled to the battery pack, the inverter, and the at least one electric motor, said controller configured to manage power flow between the battery pack and the at least one electric motor, and to control operation of the at least one electric motor; and
    a charging interface electrically coupled to the battery pack, said charging interface configured to receive external electrical power for recharging the plurality of solid-state rechargeable electrochemical cells.

A process for the polymerization of an α-olefin, comprising:
