maintaining said reaction zone at an effective polymerization temperature ranging from about 0°C to about 200°C and an effective polymerization pressure ranging from about 1 bar to about 100 bar;
and recovering a poly-α-olefin therefrom.

1. A metallic ink jet printing system for graphics applications, comprising:
