    a substrate transport mechanism configured to position a substrate relative to the ink jet printhead for printing;
    a controller coupled to the ink jet printhead and the substrate transport mechanism, the controller configured to receive graphics data and generate print control signals for causing the ink jet printhead to selectively eject the metallic ink composition onto the substrate to form a metallic graphic thereon according to the graphics data; and
    a curing apparatus positioned to treat the metallic ink composition deposited on the substrate to fix the metallic graphic.

A lost circulation material formulation comprising:
