An apparatus for controlled removal of stenotic material from a stent located within a body lumen, comprising:
a flexible catheter body configured for intravascular delivery to a stent deployed within a body lumen;
a treatment element disposed at a distal end of the flexible catheter body, the treatment element configured to interact with and remove stenotic material from the stent;
