imparting an impact force to the secured motor vehicle sub-system utilizing an impactor, said impactor being configured to reproduce a load profile or deformation profile representative of a full vehicle side impact event;
determining at least one impact-related parameter associated with the sub-system during the application of the impact force; and
evaluating the determined impact-related parameter to ascertain the side impact performance of the motor vehicle sub-system.

