producing a wear leveling initiation signal in response to detecting the wear imbalance; and
initiating a wear leveling process within the non-volatile memory prompted by the wear leveling initiation signal, wherein the wear leveling process relocates data among the plurality of memory blocks to mitigate the wear imbalance.

