a second component rotatably associated with the first component;
a sensing module coupled to at least one of the first component and the second component, the sensing module adapted to ascertain a relative angular position between the first component and the second component; and
an output unit configured to provide a signal indicative of the ascertained relative angular position.

An electrophoresis cell for concurrently electrophoresing multiple slab gels, said cell comprising:
