a first electrode disposed within and electrically coupled to the upper buffer reservoir;
a second electrode disposed within and electrically coupled to the lower buffer reservoir;
electrical contacts arranged for electrical connection between an external power supply and said first and second electrodes;
and a lid adapted to seal the upper buffer reservoir and to engage said electrical contacts.

A system for administering and disseminating electronic messages via electronic message distribution lists, the system comprising:
a data store arranged to hold multiple electronic distribution lists, each electronic distribution list comprising multiple distinct recipient identifiers;
a network interface adapted to dispatch electronic messages to designated recipient identifiers over a network; and
a processor operatively connected to the data store and the network interface, the processor configured to:
  administer the electronic distribution lists retained within the data store, including generation of new lists, incorporation of recipient identifiers into existing lists, and excision of recipient identifiers from existing lists;
  obtain an originating electronic message for subsequent distribution;
  obtain a designation for a particular electronic distribution list from said multiple lists;
  fetch, from the data store, the multiple distinct recipient identifiers linked to said particular electronic distribution list; and
  direct the network interface to dispatch the originating electronic message to each of said fetched multiple distinct recipient identifiers.

A color wheel module for an image display device, the module including:
a housing establishing an optical path;
a color wheel rotatably positioned within the housing, the color wheel having a plurality of color segments, each segment arranged to transmit light of a distinct spectral characteristic;
a motor mechanically linked to the color wheel, the motor adapted to rotate the color wheel;
a bearing assembly providing rotational support for the color wheel; and
