a compensation signal generator configured to form a compensation signal derived from said determined distortion characteristics; and
a signal corrector configured to integrate said compensation signal with either said input signal or said amplified signal to yield a compensated output signal that exhibits diminished distortion relative to said amplified signal.

A method for managing interference between diverse wireless communication technologies, the method comprising:
