deploying a software-defined private branch exchange application onto a personal computer;
importing the extracted configuration data and operating parameters into the deployed software-defined private branch exchange application; and
setting up communication hardware and software interfaces within the personal computer to mirror the telephony connectivity of the embedded PBX system, thus allowing the personal computer to function as a private branch exchange system.

A method for charging a battery, comprising:
