applying a first charging stage to the battery;
thereafter applying a second charging stage to the battery; and
subsequently applying a third charging stage to the battery, wherein the charging parameters employed in each of the first, second, and third charging stages are adjusted in view of the acquired temperature reading.

A chip carrier comprising:
