a co-crosslinking agent;
a filler; and
a curing agent;
wherein the molded rubber composition exhibits a Shore D hardness from about 40 to about 70; and
wherein the molded rubber composition has a rebound resilience of at least about 70%.

1. A sheet processing apparatus, comprising:
