    a processing station disposed along the sheet transport path and configured to perform a processing operation on the at least one sheet;
    a sheet output unit configured to discharge the at least one sheet after the processing operation; and
    a controller configured to control the sheet input unit, the sheet transport path, the processing station, and the sheet output unit to execute a series of sheet processing operations.

1. A tilt apparatus for an outboard engine, including:
