treating the interior surface of the metal container to improve adhesion of a lining material thereto;
depositing a polymeric lining material onto the treated interior surface of the metal container; and
curing the deposited polymeric lining material to form a substantially continuous and adherent lining on the interior surface of the metal container.

A method for controlling an output voltage of a fuel cell system, the method comprising:
