        a slider mechanically coupled to the flexure, the slider comprising a read/write head configured to read data from and write data to the at least one magnetic disk; and
        a PZT element affixed to the suspension;
    wherein the PZT element is adapted to enable fine positioning adjustment of the slider with respect to the at least one magnetic disk.

An actuator comprising:
