a plurality of dimples disposed on an exterior surface of the outer cover layer, said dimples including at least two distinct dimple shapes and having a total dimple volume that provides an aerodynamic lift coefficient within a range of 0.25 to 0.35 at a clubhead speed of 90 mph.

An antimicrobial application system, comprising:
