an applicator fluidly coupled with said antimicrobial agent storage reservoir, said applicator arranged to deliver the antimicrobial agent onto a target surface;
a collection basin situated to collect surplus antimicrobial agent from the target surface following application;
a filtration unit fluidly connected to said collection basin, said filtration unit adapted to extract impurities from the surplus antimicrobial agent; and
a pump arranged to convey the filtered antimicrobial agent from said filtration unit back to said antimicrobial agent storage reservoir for subsequent reuse.

1. An apparatus comprising:
   a mounting plate adapted for attachment to a basketball backboard;
   a basketball rim;
   a pivot mechanism structured to rotatably join the basketball rim to the mounting plate, thereby enabling the basketball rim to pivot downward from a horizontal playing position;
   a biasing mechanism arranged to apply an upward force on the basketball rim to restore the basketball rim to the horizontal playing position following downward pivoting; and
   a stop mechanism structured to inhibit the basketball rim from pivoting upward past the horizontal playing position.

1. An assembly for customized application of index tabs to indexing material, the assembly comprising:
