a blending processing unit coupled to said input interface, said blending processing unit having dedicated hardware logic circuitry configured to:
    produce a first intermediate product by multiplying a first input data operand from said plurality of input data operands by said at least one blending factor;
    produce a second intermediate product by multiplying a second input data operand from said plurality of input data operands by a complement of said at least one blending factor;
