a positioning mechanism mounted on the mobile chassis, the positioning mechanism comprising an attachment interface for securing an inspection device and a motion assembly configured to adjust a spatial position and orientation of the held inspection device with respect to the mobile chassis; and
a control system electronically linked with the propulsion system and the positioning mechanism, the control system configured to control the propulsion system to move the mobile chassis and to control the motion assembly to position the inspection device.

A hybrid integrated circuit for a gas sensing device, comprising:
