a gas sensing element disposed on the substrate, the gas sensing element adapted to generate an electrical signal upon detection of a gas;
signal processing circuitry disposed on the substrate and electrically coupled to the gas sensing element, the signal processing circuitry adapted to process the electrical signal from the gas sensing element;
control circuitry disposed on the substrate and electrically connected to at least one of the gas sensing element or the signal processing circuitry, the control circuitry adapted to control operational parameters of the gas sensing element;
an output interface disposed on the substrate and in electrical communication with at least one of the signal processing circuitry or the control circuitry, the output interface adapted to output data indicative of the detected gas;
and electrical interconnections provided on the substrate, interconnecting the gas sensing element, the signal processing circuitry, the control circuitry, and the output interface.

A system for firmware-managed supply voltage regulation, comprising:
