a separable fastening mechanism positioned along said first longitudinal edge and said second longitudinal edge, said fastening mechanism configured to selectively engage and disengage said first and second longitudinal edges, thereby allowing said sock to transition between an open, substantially planar configuration and a closed, foot-receiving tubular configuration.

1. A display environment, comprising:
