an output driver coupled to the control unit, said output driver adapted to generate an output drive signal for controlling said LED driver circuit, wherein said output drive signal regulates said operating parameter of the LED string to substantially maintain it at the predetermined reference parameter.

A semiconductor interconnect comprising:
