wherein the at least one reservoir is adapted to contain a bonding material; and
wherein the bonding material is adapted for delivery from the at least one reservoir to the bonding interface during a bonding operation, thereby forming a metallurgical bond between the conductive pathway and at least one of the first semiconductor element or the second semiconductor element.

A luminous fishing lure, comprising:
