    an inverter electrically coupled between the battery pack and the at least one electric motor, the inverter arranged to convert direct current (DC) power from the battery pack into alternating current (AC) power for driving the at least one electric motor;
    a controller electrically coupled to the battery pack, the inverter, and the at least one electric motor, the controller adapted to manage power transfer between the battery pack and the at least one electric motor, and to oversee operation of the at least one electric motor; and
    a charging interface electrically coupled to the battery pack, the charging interface adapted to accept external electrical power to replenish the multiple solid-state rechargeable electrochemical cells.

A method for polymerizing an α-olefin, comprising:
