wherein said catalyst system includes a transition metal compound and an activator;
operating said reaction zone at an effective polymerization temperature of from about 0°C to about 200°C and an effective polymerization pressure of from about 1 bar to about 100 bar;
and obtaining a poly-α-olefin therefrom.

1. A metallic ink jet printing system adapted for graphics applications, comprising:
    an ink jet printhead configured to eject metallic ink droplets;
