    a substrate transport mechanism arranged to position a substrate relative to the ink jet printhead for printing;
    a controller coupled to the ink jet printhead and the substrate transport mechanism, the controller configured to receive graphics data and generate control signals for directing the ink jet printhead to selectively eject the metallic ink composition onto the substrate, thereby forming a metallic graphic consistent with the graphics data; and
    a curing apparatus positioned to treat the metallic ink composition deposited on the substrate to fixate the metallic graphic.

A lost circulation material formulation comprising:
