the compound spinal rod adapted to be received and secured by the deflectable post of the bone anchor;
the compound spinal rod further arranged to distribute biomechanical loads across multiple vertebral segments, thereby furnishing a low profile spinal prosthesis for stabilization of a spinal segment.

A DC-DC converter assembly, comprising:
