an output interface operatively connected to the processing unit, the output interface configured to output the calculated cross slope.

A method for health and disease management, comprising:
acquiring patient data, wherein said patient data encompasses physiological and/or behavioral metrics derived from one or more patient-worn sensors or input devices;
