provisioning a standby pseudowire between the first PE device and the second PE device, wherein the standby pseudowire is arranged to transmit service traffic following failure of the active pseudowire;
forwarding the service traffic via the active pseudowire;
monitoring the status of the active pseudowire;
identifying a fault condition in the active pseudowire from said monitoring; and
upon detection of said fault, diverting the service traffic from the active pseudowire to the standby pseudowire.

An oscillator, comprising:
