A method for encoding and decoding a series of images, comprising:
    at an encoder, receiving an input series of images;
    analyzing at least one characteristic of said input series of images;
    adaptively selecting an encoding transformation scheme from a plurality of available schemes based on said at least one characteristic;
    applying said selected encoding transformation scheme to encode said input series of images into an encoded bitstream;
    generating said encoded bitstream, said encoded bitstream comprising information indicative of said selected encoding transformation scheme;
    and, at a decoder, receiving said encoded bitstream;
    extracting said information indicative of said selected encoding transformation scheme from said encoded bitstream;
    adaptively selecting a decoding transformation scheme corresponding to said extracted information;
    applying said selected decoding transformation scheme to decode said encoded bitstream into a reconstructed series of images;
    and outputting said reconstructed series of images.

