analyzing said environment definition to determine a sequenced deployment order for said plurality of interdependent software and/or hardware components based on said detailed inter-component dependencies;
automatically deploying each of said plurality of interdependent software and/or hardware components onto one or more target computing resources according to said sequenced deployment order;
applying specific configuration parameters to each of said deployed components in accordance with said environment definition; and
executing a validation check to confirm the effective and functional installation of said complex computer environment.

A device comprising:
