a variable gain element coupled to the signal input, the variable gain element adapted to apply a variable gain to the input signal;
a signal detector connected to an output of the variable gain element, the signal detector adapted to ascertain a signal level characteristic of the signal produced by the variable gain element;
an output port arranged to provide an output signal derived from the signal produced by the variable gain element; and
a controller interconnected with the signal detector and the variable gain element, the controller operative to generate a gain control signal in response to the measured signal level characteristic and to furnish the gain control signal to the variable gain element for adjusting its variable gain, wherein the gain control signal is generated to sustain the signal level characteristic of the output signal substantially constant at a predefined target level.

