a monitoring unit arranged to continually evaluate one or more operational parameters associated with the pipeline system;
a control unit electronically linked to the monitoring unit, the control unit being adapted to establish a target operating speed for one or more of the plurality of processing segments based on the evaluated operational parameter; and
