    a file size determination component configured to ascertain the size of the identified file;
    a drive selection component configured to dynamically select a target storage drive from available storage drives for the identified file, based on its determined size; and
    a file migration component configured to transfer the identified file from the source storage drive to the selected target storage drive.

A communication system, comprising:
a first communication apparatus including a first processor and a first transceiver, the first processor configured to generate transmission data and to direct the first transceiver to convey said data;
a second communication apparatus including a second processor and a second transceiver, the second processor configured to acquire incoming data via the second transceiver and to process the acquired data;
a communication channel interconnecting the first communication apparatus and the second communication apparatus to enable data exchange therebetween;
wherein at least one of the first communication apparatus and the second communication apparatus is configured to monitor a plurality of channel conditions of the communication channel; and
wherein at least one of the first communication apparatus and the second communication apparatus is further configured to adjust at least one transmission parameter of the transmission data based on the monitored channel conditions to optimize a communication performance metric.

A system comprising:
