a control unit connected to the tuning circuit, the control unit operative to generate a control signal for the tuning circuit;
wherein the control unit is further adapted to ascertain a desired characteristic for the band pass filter and to generate the control signal in accordance with the desired characteristic;
and wherein the tuning circuit is further operative to adjust said one or more characteristics of the band pass filter responsive to the control signal.

A conveyance control system, comprising:
multiple sensors adapted to obtain operational data pertaining to a conveyance and environmental data related to the conveyance's surroundings;
a processing unit electronically coupled to the multiple sensors, the processing unit arranged to receive the operational data and the environmental data, to analyze said received data according to a predetermined control logic, and to produce one or more control commands for the conveyance;
an actuation interface linked to the processing unit, the actuation interface adapted to transmit the one or more control commands to one or more conveyance actuators to alter an operational state of the conveyance, said operational state comprising at least one of a speed, a direction, an acceleration, or a position of the conveyance;
a communication interface electronically linked to the processing unit, the communication interface arranged to receive external control inputs pertaining to the conveyance and to transmit conveyance operational status data to an external system; and
a memory unit coupled to the processing unit, the memory unit storing instructions executable by the processing unit to execute the predetermined control logic and retaining operational parameters for controlling the conveyance.

1. An apparatus for processing seismic data, comprising:
